","title":"Re: < no title >","time":766520030,"poster":"Kyoko",]),(["id":6,"title":"Monk Again :)","body":"Ok Elon, I posted in the wrong board. but .. tell you the truth,
I don't think it matters :) , wiz usually just goes around
all boards and read all of them anyways.. :) anyhow..

How practical is 勸架?
	Would Lv>10 people go around and annoy others with this
skill just for some minute experiance? I don't think so.. Healers
get experiance for healing for depoisening, but do healer go
around and heal mobs, or encourage people to get poisoned for that
single diget or at most double diget exp? No. So if the exp is 
small enough, small means just symbolic like the heal/depoison for
healers. Lower Lv monk can't really successfully 勸架 without getting attack
from mob or both mob and pc, and Higher Lv monk won't really disturb
others for the exp since the exp is just symbolic. This is just like
people will ask if others need help before joining a fight. People 
would almost ask first before try to 勸架. 
Ruby said that the situation would be rare.. well.. This situation happens the most right after
reboot when people have light eq. I'm sure you've all seen
bunch of eq less pc try to kill a mob. 勸架 is just the right skill
for that situation. ... lower lv people get killed fast.. but sometime higher level
pc need it when attacked by even stronger mob.. say.. flesh eater? :b
